# The two ups are the walkthrough's own demonstration failures:
# first the chain (not brave enough), then bravely into the metal
# shutters. The shop wing stays shuttered -- the route in is
# nothing the walkthrough's room-keyed sections ever spell out.
u
u

# To the foyer, whose central dais is the way up: examining it
# reveals a small black button, and the exact dance below -- seen,
# pushed, pushed, then stood upon -- is what summons an
# upside-down Christmas tree through the ceiling hole on a cable.
# (This game gates on discovered knowledge on purpose: touching
# the corridor's secret wall before learning of it in-game earns
# Ingold's taunt "Playing a restored game are we?")
